description:
Match URL paths to pages, the way a single-page app does.

```
route("/")              -> { page: "home", params: {} }
route("/users/42")      -> { page: "user", params: { id: "42" } }
route("/users/42/posts/7") -> { page: "post", params: { id: "42", postId: "7" } }
route("/nope")          -> { page: "not-found", params: {} }
```

